<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 14.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 14.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    89/92     96/97	UNQ     198/202</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   98/99    105/106   198/200   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes fell on poor enquiries and ample supplies, traders said on Monday. Volumes transacted were poor with shipowners sidelined, waiting for prices to fall. At least two Venezuelan cargoes were heard arriving later this month, putting pressure on 380-cst prices, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
